# Generated by `cem analyze` — regenerated by the storybook, build-storybook and
# prepack scripts, so it never needs to be committed. Tracking it only produced
# churn: cem rewrites every JSDoc string with the checkout's line endings and
# writes absolute paths for modules it cannot resolve, so the file came back
# dirty after any unrelated edit.
